<title>USA: Chelan County, Wash., yields 5.45 pct in 2014.</title>
<headline>Chelan County, Wash., yields 5.45 pct in 2014.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc said it priced $9.045 million of Chelan County, Wash., general obligation limited tax bonds, with a top yield of 5.40 percent in 2014.</p>
